@* Decision 0011 (run W4, unit R9): the import review of Settings › Data & storage (#modal-data-import). After a settings file is chosen,
   data.js asks POST /api/data/import/preview what it would change and lists it here: each item (a settings section, a custom provider, a
   built-in provider's overrides, a preset) with a checkbox and every changed key with this machine's value and the file's, an item that
   can't be imported with why (unchecked and disabled), and what the file leaves out. Nothing is saved until Import; then only the checked
   items are imported (POST /api/data/import). Everything is set as text, never HTML. Model: none. *@
<div class="modal fade" id="modal-data-import" tabindex="-1" aria-labelledby="modal-data-import-title" aria-hidden="true" data-data-import>
  <div class="modal-dialog modal-dialog-centered modal-dialog-scrollable modal-lg">
    <div class="modal-content">
      <div class="modal-header">
        <div style="min-width:0">
          <h2 class="modal-title" id="modal-data-import-title">Import settings</h2>
          <div class="fs-8 text-ps-faint ps-mono text-break" data-import-source></div>
        </div>
        <button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Close"></button>
      </div>
      <div class="modal-body">
        <p class="fs-7 text-secondary mb-3" data-import-summary></p>
        <div class="d-grid gap-2" data-import-items></div>
        <ul class="fs-8 text-ps-faint mt-3 mb-0 ps-3" data-import-notes hidden></ul>
        <template data-import-item-template>
          <div class="ps-card p-3" data-import-item>
            <div class="form-check mb-1">
              <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" data-import-check>
              <label class="form-check-label fw-semibold fs-7" data-import-title></label>
            </div>
            <div class="fs-8 text-ps-warn mb-1" data-import-problem hidden></div>
            <div class="table-responsive">
              <table class="table table-sm fs-8 mb-0 align-top">
                <thead><tr><th scope="col">Setting</th><th scope="col">This machine</th><th scope="col">The file</th></tr></thead>
                <tbody data-import-changes></tbody>
              </table>
            </div>
          </div>
        </template>
      </div>
      <div class="modal-footer">
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-secondary" data-bs-dismiss="modal">Cancel</button>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary" data-import-apply disabled>Import</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
